    <item>
      <title>plasma one绑apple pay方法</title>
      <link>https://linux.do/t/topic/2475786</link>
      <guid>linux.do-topic-2475786</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 25 Jun 2026 13:54:56 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>
            &lt;p&gt;发现个稳定绑苹果的方法，&lt;br&gt;
1.先关梯子。&lt;br&gt;
2.选择添加借记卡或信用卡（只能点击+号输）。&lt;br&gt;
3.手动输卡号，遇到失败就无脑重试，一般重试一次就ok了。&lt;br&gt;
4.输到期时间和cvv。&lt;br&gt;
5.弹到联系发卡机构，同意协议。&lt;br&gt;
6.同意后开梯子（我用的是美国ip，万人骑那种）。&lt;br&gt;
7.等一下，会让你输验证信息，电话或者邮箱验证码。输完就成了。&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/f/c/9/fc9050ad96831273b53dc58ecd5e8abdb35ada27.jpeg&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/A2hw0MH7TT6ShbcQZlF1gIEJ6sL.jpeg?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;ecbaee5fe4f8d058ced0967f15938099&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/f/c/9/fc9050ad96831273b53dc58ecd5e8abdb35ada27_2_231x500.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;ecbaee5fe4f8d058ced0967f15938099&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;A2hw0MH7TT6ShbcQZlF1gIEJ6sL&quot; width=&quot;231&quot; height=&quot;500&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/f/c/9/fc9050ad96831273b53dc58ecd5e8abdb35ada27_2_231x500.jpeg, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/f/c/9/fc9050ad96831273b53dc58ecd5e8abdb35ada27_2_346x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/f/c/9/fc9050ad96831273b53dc58ecd5e8abdb35ada27_2_462x1000.jpeg 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;82827F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
